<title>UK: Berlin Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    07.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST THREE MONTHS, THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 STEPS-UP TO 4.70 PCT.</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 53</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
